# BMW 5 Series E34 four-door saloon, 1988-1996.
#
# The E34 5-series: 4,720 mm long, 1,751 mm wide, 1,412 mm high, 2,761 mm
# wheelbase; 1.8-4.0 sixes and V8s, the 525i the volume model. The class-3
# executive saloon of the early 1990s in the section F research.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BMW_5_Series_(E34)
#
# Colours: Cosmos Black, Sterling Silver, Avus Blue and Oxford Green are
# documented BMW finishes of the period.
#
# Weight: 150 in total (black 45, silver 40, blue 35, green 30).
#
# Speed 220 km/h; comfort 120/510 (line). Classes 2,3.
# Dates: 1988-1996 with a road tail to about 2008.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bmw-e34.blend. References:
# citycars/references/bmw-e34/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

